{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "05dbf5f24da64304d38e0f8b31cb8493c24e965e14e33b8abb6c2d114e406b8b", "ja": "ドキドキなアイディア", "zh": "心跳加速的点子", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "ec150de22a45ec9ced162c274ced745bc75bdcb33f64fce22379cad515c04d81", "ja": "いよいよ新曲のレコーディング。やよい達は\n楽しそうに新曲を歌い上げる。そんな中、\n歌詞に出てきた流れ星を、育が実際に見たこ\nとがないと聞いたプロデューサーは、4人と\n本物の流れ星を見に行くことにする。", "zh": "新歌的录音终于开始了，弥生等人开心地唱着\n新歌。这时制作人听说育没有看过歌词中出现\n的流星，于是决定带着四人一起去看看真正的\n流星。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_04_1000_p", "source_sha256": "5ba226bd28b386a06e8316a52c01d6338e661311dab19d93b3fc051f56a9b51b", "ja": "（今日はいよいよ新曲のレコーディングだ。\nみんな、気合い十分みたいだな！）", "zh": "（今天终于要开始录新歌了，\n大家看起来都干劲十足呢！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_04_1001_onkyou", "source_sha256": "206a487eabbe040e31ff3597ddf429bece8d068be67c5382ae2f2e106be7d55a", "ja": "それじゃあ、そろそろ始めようか。\nみんな、今日はよろしくね！", "zh": "那我们差不多就开始吧。\n各位，今天请多指教啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_04_1002_005yay", "source_sha256": "058865d01a01b4a41ff516744138e8238464a45660a0e6a245eb7a86a8b95e65", "ja": "よろしくお願いしまーす！", "zh": "请多多指教──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_04_1003_036kan", "source_sha256": "058865d01a01b4a41ff516744138e8238464a45660a0e6a245eb7a86a8b95e65", "ja": "よろしくお願いしまーす！", "zh": "请多多指教──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_04_1004_030iku", "source_sha256": "058865d01a01b4a41ff516744138e8238464a45660a0e6a245eb7a86a8b95e65", "ja": "よろしくお願いしまーす！", "zh": "请多多指教──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_04_1005_040tam", "source_sha256": "058865d01a01b4a41ff516744138e8238464a45660a0e6a245eb7a86a8b95e65", "ja": "よろしくお願いしまーす！", "zh": "请多多指教──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_04_1006_onkyou", "source_sha256": "d2ae160eb040c086aba89e79fafefca7b7b407c6ea87de044cf2142025fb2631", "ja": "うん……オッケー！　これで全員終了かな？\nみんな、お疲れさまでした！", "zh": "嗯……OK！这样所有人都录完了吧？\n大家辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_04_1007_005yay", "source_sha256": "135e44e8582b50c7c6c80991df87b85dbe38e85463c868649af482bf72af3b04", "ja": "お疲れさまです！\nありがとうございましたー！", "zh": "辛苦了！\n谢谢大家──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_04_1008_036kan", "source_sha256": "f804bad4b2e2246663fe4b0f3392d451af209195256c20b9f6ee022a88d4bca3", "ja": "はぁ～、ちょっと緊張したけど、楽しかったね！\nどんなふうになるのかな～♪　早く聞きたいな～♪", "zh": "呼～虽然有点紧张，但很有趣呢！\n会变成什么样子呢～♪真想早点听到～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_04_1009_030iku", "source_sha256": "0a4c79e8e6db47fad86dca7ddbe49794dc42471af06208d61494da538de014ce", "ja": "{$P$}さん、\nわたし達の歌、どうだった？　じょうずに歌えてた？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，\n我们的歌怎么样？唱得好听吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_04_1010_p", "source_sha256": "8f299010628aac6f45e4d4d7d30e6dd9d3511c4f8c9f69f68263179acf6eb377", "ja": "ああ、よかったぞ。\n曲のイメージにぴったりだったよ。", "zh": "嗯，很好听喔。\n和歌曲的印象一拍即合喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_04_1011_040tam", "source_sha256": "320f69cd5e821024bf3c03a09ac21476ed77239fb57d23af6c817f6cfaf37a55", "ja": "ホント！？\nくふふ……おやぶんにほめられちゃった～♪", "zh": "真的吗！？\n呵呵……被老大称赞了～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_04_1012_036kan", "source_sha256": "56accd939d0049ec7dac34639ad1460813f42083acf6a444d0655a86e9f59c53", "ja": "素敵な曲だったな～。歌ってて楽しかったし！\nねえねえ、みんなはこの歌、どこが一番気に入った？", "zh": "真是首美妙的歌～唱起来真开心！\n欸欸，大家最喜欢这首歌的哪个部分？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_04_1013_036kan", "source_sha256": "0f92faadbf2d3186980852991faa00783dc1182fa0cdd2295022903f0e69691f", "ja": "私はね、頑張り屋さんがあくびするところ！\nだって、私もいっぱいあくびしちゃうから。えへ♪", "zh": "我喜欢勤奋的人会打哈欠那里！\n因为我也常常在打呵欠，嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_04_1014_040tam", "source_sha256": "80ee1de0f419bd5f1c8023562bb634491b02a2fa9415447262300ee5ce2fcd5e", "ja": "たまきはたまきは、えっと、え～っと……、\n動物がパジャマを着て、ぷかぷかしてるところ！", "zh": "环的是环的是，呃，呃～……\n动物穿上睡衣，飘来飘去的地方！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_04_1015_040tam", "source_sha256": "e58eeb96f53e19cefa32baa97f4ea5c64dbc82b65930504a6fa4debb9fd7de7a", "ja": "もし、こぶんが空を飛んでたら、\nきっとすっごくかわいいもん！", "zh": "如果小弟也飞到空中，\n一定会超级可爱的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_04_1016_005yay", "source_sha256": "afab35d96a05c38c16393560f948f9ac6173c0ff229682b7a511443ac40a8dff", "ja": "私は……え～っと～……\nぜーんぶ、好きかなーって！", "zh": "我是……我想～想～……\n全～部都喜欢──这样吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_04_1017_036kan", "source_sha256": "9a71d72907e118b0e8ca2f9456ff140f7ccf4c1a0dc6f62afdadab74cbe1f40c", "ja": "あ～！　やよいちゃん、それってずるい～！", "zh": "啊～！弥生，你太贼了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_04_1018_005yay", "source_sha256": "a9cae5762d6664774d8b029714cca04bb9889a542d1ce5126a008290fc9818b2", "ja": "えへへ、ごめんね♪\n素敵なところがいっぱいで、選べないんだもん～！", "zh": "嘿嘿，抱歉♪\n好的地方太多了，我选不出来嘛～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_04_1020_p", "source_sha256": "dc129d13c3085c3cdaf69ea35f7479329344f23f10406bb98abd97dac1d1cf76", "ja": "（……育？　なんだか静かだな。さっきの歌も\n悪くはなかったが、いまいち乗れていなかったような）", "zh": "（……育？总觉得她有点安静呢。\n她刚刚虽然唱得不差，但似乎无法很投入。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_04_1021_p", "source_sha256": "1440a44db95f4bd3dfb2b171c58bd403f3ebc3cc021120e6c36ca4ab2c76d36c", "ja": "……なあ、育。\n育はどこが好きだった？", "zh": "……嘿，育。\n你喜欢哪个部分？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_04_1022_030iku", "source_sha256": "07154d8094d553eb2752a7b7b771f22d70796cae4432645272e03f12beb46543", "ja": "え、わたし？　わたしは……う～ん……。\n流れ星が出てくるところ、かな？", "zh": "咦，我吗？我啊……嗯……\n应该是有流星出现的地方吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_04_1023_030iku", "source_sha256": "63351e5ea4045f2254f32fe5d977ce176d5c1dc988fa09c4335181b9c175753b", "ja": "テレビでね、流れ星が流れるところを\n見たことあるんだけど、すごくキレイだったから。", "zh": "因为我有在电视上看过\n流星划过天空的样子，非常漂亮。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_04_1024_040tam", "source_sha256": "06da1889ce79d10169d428f53f8ea052a4357c25bb98a6ce51d7dd37f2cc0a8e", "ja": "育は本物の流れ星を見たことないの？", "zh": "育没有亲眼看过流星吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_04_1025_040tam", "source_sha256": "c8681fcfe3ebb68a5707cf3f2060a6d8e4dfc373f6d15bcd31b34ae87699859e", "ja": "たまきは3回あるよ！\nばあちゃんの家にいた時に見たんだ～。", "zh": "环看过三次喔！\n在奶奶家的时候看到的～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_04_1026_030iku", "source_sha256": "4a9d99a69892fbb0562e190b9a8c8d43e8df92bf78bad50b807831e8909ca900", "ja": "いいなぁ～、環ちゃん。\nわたしも本物の流れ星、見てみたいなー……。", "zh": "好好喔～小环。\n我也好想亲眼看看流星喔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_04_1028_005yay", "source_sha256": "07dba82ec71b9a461fd7f7e69aab334554b9d4887d7f9a049177205d63a44dc8", "ja": "あ、そうだ！　{$P$}、\n流れ星って、みんなで見に行ったらダメですか～？", "zh": "啊，对了！{$P$}，\n我们可不可以一起去看流星呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_04_1029_005yay", "source_sha256": "d867e84ac87821d13ddb05d66af9c1cc4a33080429ee6ea8df414ee13b62259b", "ja": "CDのリリースイベントが終わったら、\n私達4人で一緒に！　みんなも、どうかな？", "zh": "CD的发片活动结束后，我们四个人一起去！\n大家觉得怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_04_1030_036kan", "source_sha256": "b94269e50e6b98d0b77df202b51c635b3d1153ba2e7c877177afa25ee0bad8f1", "ja": "わぁ、ステキ！　きっと楽しい流れ星～♪\nみんなで探せば見つかりそう♪", "zh": "哇，好棒喔！看流星一定很开心～♪\n大家一起找应该就能找到♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_04_1031_040tam", "source_sha256": "9276ca3f3a8f81a0e08007b9402dc5512ae3c96d7ad5db4ef950488e45129506", "ja": "たまきもいきたい！　流れ星、いつもきれいだもん！", "zh": "环也想去！流星不管什么时候都很漂亮嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_04_1032_030iku", "source_sha256": "216aa5dc08312c26a98b781f1b58d30f360ca3aceea77cdc2a56ac003a62dfa9", "ja": "あ、わ、わたしも！", "zh": "啊，我、我也想去！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_04_1033", "source_sha256": "98eedc2a1e4cadc1f6e6bd8d04e68a29a670522868b9138650e5be5d6098cef0", "ja": "任せろ！", "zh": "交给我吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_04_2000_p", "source_sha256": "fe84f056243d81fa2976eefe6da7022a764c802b64e36eeb109abcd9122ec1ba", "ja": "だったら任せてくれ。俺が皆を連れて行くよ。\nアイドル活動の一環としてな。", "zh": "那就交给我吧，我带大家去。\n作为偶像活动的一环。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_04_2001_005yay", "source_sha256": "977ed2312c34bb102a23df72983677f3368203574df4741930265127471d3d70", "ja": "えっ？　それって……お仕事でってことですか？", "zh": "咦？意思是……这是工作吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_04_2002_p", "source_sha256": "b8489f9780b0be4402de22fcc51cc1e5ca3e7d5e98a55398b17962156dec6661", "ja": "そう、流れ星を見てから、もう一度レコーディングして\nみないか？　もっと歌に入り込めるかもしれないぞ。", "zh": "没错，看过流星之后，要不要再录一次音？\n说不定能更投入到歌曲当中喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_04_2003_036kan", "source_sha256": "cc83005540aa4a091b5313f6acbd1ddfb58e2a04ee7cc32998410ccaa1876cae", "ja": "わぁ！　それってなんだか、ロマンチックですね！", "zh": "哇！感觉好浪漫喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_04_2004_030iku", "source_sha256": "52282960ed054ffc9ab5033f442c0810ce3109d73089d8863e4485b3f2b8df80", "ja": "あの、でも……{$P$}さん、いいの？\n流れ星って、遠くにいかなきゃ見れないんでしょ？", "zh": "那个，但是……{$P$}先生，真的吗？\n要去很远的地方才看得到流星吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_04_2005_030iku", "source_sha256": "5a23e01a3cc93699c78bb1610a32011b58a850a4fc0c6d68d91cb243cfd2a221", "ja": "あんまり遠いところだと、時間かかっちゃうかも。\nそしたら、お仕事だってできないし……。", "zh": "如果是很远的地方，应该会很花时间，\n这样也就不能工作了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_04_2006_p", "source_sha256": "226839ebc22bf07f02084aec7d334fb35b392cba9b2832a59830f8b1a8c289a9", "ja": "大丈夫、これも大切なお仕事だよ。\nそれに……。", "zh": "没问题，这也是很重要的工作喔。\n而且……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_04_2007_p", "source_sha256": "4e78859e79efcce1cdef2f681db433836f2eaaf59091837cbeaaa9d6f7205d0b", "ja": "少しでも曲が良くなるなら、できることは何でもする。\n今の俺達にとっては、それが一番大切なことなんだ。", "zh": "只要能让歌曲更完美一点，我们都会尽力去做。\n对现在的我们来说，那就是最重要的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_04_2008_030iku", "source_sha256": "2098101efad061c90507916e888bbc3dd0c532434643bbd93910d5a081b94581", "ja": "わぁ……！\nえへへ、ありがとう、{$P$}さん！", "zh": "哇……！\n嘿嘿，谢谢你，{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_04_2009_040tam", "source_sha256": "490356cb84f0ec72f0c2097b05046aab7a41a9ada690dd3d07b5d30f54b05c73", "ja": "わ～い！　みんなで流れ星見るの楽しみ～！\nおやぶん、たまき、早く行きたい……！", "zh": "耶～！好期待和大家一起看流星～！\n老大，环好想快点出发……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_04_2010_p", "source_sha256": "3aad6c6092958415a34e4c0729ccd76596a5c287f9cf856035571b8a5328213e", "ja": "みんなのスケジュールは……うん、大丈夫だ。\nちょっと調整すれば、近いうちに行けそうだな！", "zh": "大家的行程……嗯，没问题。\n只要稍微调整一下，应该很快就能去一趟呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
