{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_04_2015_036kan", "source_sha256": "ffc9509ef52d7c0ae988cbe9e7c4d4328050054f9f4e815f5ed9f6fbdae99264", "ja": "流れ星～♪　ビュンと流れてキラキラキラリ～♪\nみんなで見つけてハッピッピ～♪", "zh": "流星～♪咻地飞过去，闪亮闪亮亮～♪\n大家一起找到HAPPYPPY～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_04_2016_030iku", "source_sha256": "73406ef49c0dc0b67c9a64ff1dace7728810094d65fae46c336757e4fb96fc6b", "ja": "お天気、だいじょうぶかな～。\nきっと、きっとだいじょうぶだよねっ？", "zh": "会不会是好天气呢～\n一定、一定没问题的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0007_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0007_story_04_2017_005yay", "source_sha256": "397812f511e876a1a9ed566c6751e6f1c9c382d5a1ec367db3cdae48a9c80946", "ja": "うっうー！　あ～した天気……じゃなくてー、\nおでかけの日は天気にな～れ♪", "zh": "呜呜──！明～天会是……不对，\n出游日会是好～天气♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
